# Deployment-local artefacts. Kept here rather than in the repository root so
# every file outside deploy/ stays byte-identical to v2.3-hardening.

# The seeded dump is the dataset in another form: ~200MB of applicant rows,
# built locally by make_seed.sh and baked into the published image. The
# submission instructions say the dataset does not go in git, and that applies
# to it in this shape too.
postgres/*.sql.gz

# Host configuration. Holds the Anthropic key and the database passwords.
.env
